ately enters PollMap after registration - avoiding a race condition.\n\nWhen using the web auth (up -> go to the Control website -> CLI `register`) the client is polling checking if it has been authorized. If we immediately ask for the client IP, as done in CreateHeadscaleEnv() we might have the client in NotReady status.\n\nThis method provides a way to wait for the client to be ready.\n\nSigned-off-by: Juan Font Alonso <juanfontalonso@gmail.com>","parents":[{"sha":"f7ad88aa0878384309d8be8ef11eae3e34eb09e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/f7ad88aa0878384309d8be8ef11eae3e34eb09e1","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/f7ad88aa0878384309d8be8ef11eae3e34eb09e1"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"ad3c36fd07035276dee995b03437ce0aea7ca380","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKGFkM2MzNmZkMDcwMzUyNzZkZWU5OTViMDM0MzdjZTBhZWE3Y2EzODA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/ad3c36fd07035276dee995b03437ce0aea7ca380","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/ad3c36fd07035276dee995b03437ce0aea7ca380","author":{"name":"Juan Font Alonso","email":"juanfontalonso@gmail.com","date":"2022-11-13T12:12:32Z"},"committer":{"name":"Juan Font Alonso","email":"juanfontalonso@gmail.com","date":"2022-11-13T12:13:29Z"},"tree":{"sha":"0d015be9c0f25e7199f68f073b5d98cd682d48bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/0d015be9c0f25e7199f68f073b5d98cd682d48bb"},"message":"Wait for the tailscale clients to be ready in the web auth CreateHeadscaleEnv\n\nSigned-off-by: Juan Font Alonso <juanfontalonso@gmail.com>","parents":[{"sha":"f176503448ebbdea131aa11e327d43241d67dd17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/f176503448ebbdea131aa11e327d43241d67dd17","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/f176503448ebbdea131aa11e327d43241d67dd17"}],"verification":